  bubbleMessages:
  - Going for your feedback conversation? Keep these points in mind.
  - When receiving feedback, remind yourself that feedback is about growth, not judgment.
  - "Enter the conversation with a growth mindset \u2014 be open to hearing new perspectives."
  - 'Manage your expectations: feedback may feel uncomfortable. That is normal.'
  - This conversation is an opportunity for me to grow. I can listen without immediately
    reacting.
